    points: ['New A-rated combi boiler', 'New radiators with TRVs', 'All new pipework', 'Smart or programmable controls', 'Magnetic filter and inhibitor'] },
  { id: 'three-bed', tier: 'Family homes', popular: true, name: '3-bed home', price: '£5,295', from: true, unit: 'full system, inc VAT',
    points: ['New A-rated combi boiler', 'Back boiler and fire removed if you have one', 'New radiators with TRVs', 'All new pipework', 'Smart or programmable controls', 'System cleaned to BS 7593'] },
  { id: 'four-bed', tier: 'Bigger homes', name: '4-bed home', price: '£6,295', from: true, unit: 'full system, inc VAT',
    points: ['Boiler sized for a bigger home', 'New radiators with TRVs', 'All new pipework', 'Smart or programmable controls', 'Benchmark and gas safety checks'] },
  { id: 'combi-conversion', tier: 'Tank to combi', name: 'Combi conversion', price: '£2,890', from: true, unit: 'fitted, inc VAT',
    points: ['Cylinder system changed to a combi', 'Hot water cylinder and loft tanks removed', 'Keeps your radiators if they are sound', 'Usually 1 to 2 days'] },
];

const faqs = [
  { q: 'How much does central heating installation cost in St Helens?', a: 'A full new system starts from £4,495 for a 2-bed home, £5,295 for a 3-bed and £6,295 for a 4-bed, including VAT. A combi conversion starts from £2,890. You get a fixed written price after a free survey.' },
  { q: 'Do you replace back boilers in St Helens?', a: 'Yes. It is one of our most common St Helens jobs. We remove the back boiler and the gas fire in front of it, fit a new combi in a better spot, and run new pipes. A full back boiler job with new radiators usually takes 4 to 5 days.' },
  { q: 'Can you service my back boiler instead?', a: 'No. We do not service back boilers. They are old, hard to get parts for and well below modern efficiency. We remove them and fit a modern combi instead.' },
  { q: 'How much does a back boiler replacement cost?', a: 'It depends on the radiators and pipes you have. If they are sound, we may only need to swap the boiler. If they are old, a full system from £4,495 is often better value. We price it at the free survey.' },
  { q: 'Do you cover all WA postcodes in St Helens?', a: 'Yes. We cover WA9, WA10, WA11 and WA12, including Thatto Heath, Parr, Eccleston, Sutton, Haydock, Rainford and Newton-le-Willows. We also cover Billinge WN5 and Golborne WA3.' },
  { q: 'Do you fit central heating for landlords in Newton-le-Willows?', a: 'Yes. We fit systems in rented homes across WA12 and can work with your tenant or agent. Rented homes need a gas safety certificate every year, from £100 with us.' },
  { q: 'How long does central heating installation take?', a: 'A small home takes 2 to 3 days. A back boiler job or a 3-bed system takes 4 to 5 days. A big 4 or 5-bed home can take 5 to 7 days. We agree the dates at the survey.' },
  { q: 'What warranty do I get?', a: 'The boiler comes with a maker\'s warranty of 7 to 12 years, depending on the model. We register it for you. Our own work has a 12-month workmanship guarantee.' },
  { q: 'Do you offer finance?', a: 'No, we do not offer finance. You get a fixed written price, so you know the full cost before we start.' },
  { q: 'Are you Gas Safe registered?', a: 'Yes. All gas work is done by our Gas Safe registered engineers. You can check any engineer on the Gas Safe Register before they start.' },
];
---

